Insight Expect R &lt; 1 (clustering) for F&B (56) and often Sports/Recreation (93)—these sectors gravitate to footfall and amenity belts. Air (51) and Water (36) usually have few, strategic points; if n &lt; 10, the test is skipped to avoid spurious inference. Use these results as a green light for KDE and for checking that clustering isn’t only a visual illusion.

